{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-jer-15-1","title":"Jeremiah 15:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The utter rejection and manifold judgments of the Jews. 10 Jeremiah, complaining of their spite, receives a promise for himself; 12 and a threatening for them. 15 He prays; 19 and receives a gracious promise.</p>\n<p>Though. 7:16; 11:14; 14:11; Eze 14:14,21 Moses. Ex 32:11-14; Nu 14:13-20; 1Sa 7:9; 12:23; Ps 99:6 stood. 18:20; Ge 19:27; Ps 106:23; Zec 3:3; Heb 9:24 my mind. Jud 5:9; Pr 14:35 cast. 7:15; 23:39; 52:3; 2Ki 17:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-15-2","title":"Jeremiah 15:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>for death. 14:12; 24:9,10; 43:11; Isa 24:18; Eze 5:2,12; 14:21; Da 9:12 Am 5:19; Zec 11:9; Re 6:3-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-15-3","title":"Jeremiah 15:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>I will. 7:33; Le 26:16,22,25; De 28:26; 1Ki 21:23,24; 2Ki 9:35-37 Isa 18:6; 56:9,10; Eze 14:21; Re 6:8; 19:17,18 kinds. Heb. families.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-15-4","title":"Jeremiah 15:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>cause them to be removed. Heb. give them for a removing. 9:16; 24:9; 29:18; 34:17; Le 26:33; De 28:25,64; La 1:8; Eze 23:46 because. 2Ki 21:11-13; 23:26,27; 24:3,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-15-5","title":"Jeremiah 15:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>For who. 16:5; 21:7; Job 19:21; Ps 69:20; Isa 51:19; La 1:12-16; 2:15,16 Na 3:7 how thou doest. Heb. of thy peace. Ex 18:7; Jud 18:15; 1Sa 10:4; 17:22; 25:5; *margins</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-15-6","title":"Jeremiah 15:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>forsaken. 1:16; 2:13,17,19 thou art. 7:24; 8:5; Isa 1:4; 28:13; Ho 4:16; 11:7; Zec 7:11 stretch. Eze 14:9; 25:7; Zep 1:4 I am. 6:11; 20:9; Ps 78:38-40; Eze 12:26-28; Ho 13:14; Am 7:3-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-15-7","title":"Jeremiah 15:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>I will fan. 4:11,12; 51:2; Ps 1:4; Isa 41:16; Mt 3:12 bereave. 9:21; 18:21; De 28:18,32,41,53-56; Ho 9:12-17 children. or, whatsoever is dear. Eze 24:21,25 since. 5:3; 8:4,5; Isa 9:13; Am 4:10-12; Zec 1:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-15-8","title":"Jeremiah 15:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>widows. Isa 3:25,26; 4:1 the mother, etc. or, the mother city a young man spoiling,etc. or, the mother and the young men. a spoiler. 4:16; 5:6; 6:4,5; Lu 21:35</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-15-9","title":"Jeremiah 15:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>She that hath.She that hath had a numerous offspring, Jerusalem, the mother city, the parent of so many cities, villages, and families in the land.</p>\n<p>1Sa 2:5; Isa 47:9; La 1:1; 4:10 her sun. Am 8:9,10 and the. 2,3; 44:27; Eze 5:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-15-10","title":"Jeremiah 15:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>my. 20:14-18; Job 3:1-26 a man. 20; 1:18,19; 20:7,8; 1Ki 18:17,18; 21:20; 22:8; Ps 120:5,6; Eze 2:6,7 Eze 3:7-9; Mt 10:21-23; 24:9; Lu 2:34; Ac 16:20-22; 17:6-8 Ac 19:8,9,25-28; 28:22; 1Co 4:9-13 I have. Ex 22:25; De 23:19,20; Ne 5:1-6; Ps 15:5 curse. Ps 109:28; Pr 26:2; Mt 5:44; Lu 6:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-15-11","title":"Jeremiah 15:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Verily it. Ps 37:3-11; Ec 8:12 verily I. 29:11-14; 39:11,12; 40:2-6; Ps 106:46 cause the enemy to entreat thee. or, entreat the enemy forthee. Pr 16:7; 21:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-15-12","title":"Jeremiah 15:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Shall iron. 1:18,19; 21:4,5; Job 40:9; Isa 45:9; Hab 1:5-10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-15-13","title":"Jeremiah 15:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>substance. 8; 17:3; 20:5 without. Ps 44:12; Isa 52:3,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-15-14","title":"Jeremiah 15:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>pass. 4; 14:18; 16:13; 17:4; 52:27; Le 26:38,39; De 28:25,36,64; Am 5:27 a fire. 4:4; De 29:23; 32:22; Ps 21:9; Isa 42:25; 66:15,16; Na 1:5,6 Heb 12:29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-15-15","title":"Jeremiah 15:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>thou. 12:3; 17:16; Job 10:7; Ps 7:3-5; 17:3; Joh 21:15-17; 2Co 5:11 remember. 11:18-20; 20:12; Ne 5:19; 6:14; 13:22,31; Ps 106:4; 109:26-29 Ps 119:84,132-134; Lu 18:7,8; Ro 12:19; 2Ti 4:14; Re 6:10; 18:20 take. Ps 39:13; 102:24; Isa 38:3 know. 10; 11:21; 20:8; Ps 69:7-9; Mt 5:10-12; 10:22; 19:29; Lu 6:22,23 Lu 21:17; Ro 8:35; 1Pe 4:14-16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-15-16","title":"Jeremiah 15:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>I did. Eze 3:1-3; Re 10:9 thy word. Job 23:12; Ps 19:10; 119:72,97,101-103,111 I am called by thy name. Heb. thy name is called upon me. 14:9; *marg:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-15-17","title":"Jeremiah 15:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>sat not. Ps 1:1; 26:4,5; 2Co 6:17 sat alone. 13:17; La 3:28; Eze 3:24,25; Da 7:28 for. 1:10; 6:11; 20:8,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-15-18","title":"Jeremiah 15:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>my pain. 14:19; Ps 6:3; 13:1-3; La 3:1-18 my wound. 30:12,15; Job 34:6; Mic 1:9 as a. 1:18,19; 20:7 and as. 14:3; Job 6:15-20 fail. Heb. be not sure.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-15-19","title":"Jeremiah 15:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>return. 10-18; 20:9; Ex 6:29,30; Jon 3:2 stand. 1; 1Ki 17:1; Pr 22:29; Zec 3:7; Lu 1:19; 21:36; Jude 1:24 take. Le 10:10; Isa 32:5,6; Eze 22:26; 44:23; Heb 5:14 as my. Ex 4:12,15,16; Lu 10:16; 12:12; 21:15 let them. 38:20,21; Eze 2:7; 3:10,11; Ac 20:27; 2Co 5:16; Ga 1:10; 2:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-15-20","title":"Jeremiah 15:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>I will. 1:18,19; 6:27; Eze 3:9; Ac 4:8-13,29-31; 5:29-32 but. 20:11,12; Ps 124:1-3; 129:1,2; Ro 8:31-39 for. 20:11; Ps 46:7,11; Isa 7:14; 8:9,10; 41:10; Ac 18:9,10; 2Ti 4:16 2Ti 4:17,22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-15-21","title":"Jeremiah 15:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>deliver. Ge 48:16; Ps 27:2; 37:40; Isa 49:24,25; 54:17; Mt 6:13; Ro 16:20 2Co 1:10 the terrible. Isa 25:3-5; 29:5,20</p>"}]}